{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act48side_level_act48side_st03","storyGroup":"act48side","storySort":19,"storyDependence":"act48side_level_act48side_08_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"ME-ST-3","storyName":"无法再一次踏入的河","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"完成了任务的缇缇回到了萨尔贡。而在米诺斯，重建第一神殿仅仅只是个开始......","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act48side/level_act48side_st03","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act48side_st03","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":17,"characters":["莱娜","赫卡德墨","吕刻伊昂","小里底娅","小莱娜","果农代表","卡珊卓拉","帕拉斯","佩里安德洛斯","里底娅","西妮斯卡","赞索斯","缇缇","贝赫努","？？？"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_bg_69_g10_templegarden.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2","duration":"0.7","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"喏，这是需要定期服用的药物和抑制剂，我都从罗德岛办事处带过来了。","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"听说理事官办公室已经撤销了对赞索斯师徒的囚禁命令，也不打算追究你协助他们逃狱的事。","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"是的。我后来才知道，里底娅小姐早猜到了我们的计划，当时就给我大开方便之门，事后自然也不会追究。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"......","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$2","focus":"m","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"即使如此，你们也还是打算离开雅赛努斯，去其他地方游历？","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"没错。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"待在这里只会让我的老同学胡思乱想，还不如出去走走，跟更多的人交谈，做更多的事。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"没错。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"哦？很少见你如此坦诚啊，吕刻伊昂。要是你做我病人的时候能这么老实，我就不需要派三名罗德岛干员盯着你了。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"抱歉，之前给您添麻烦了......","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"看来赞索斯先生在第一神殿的行为，给你带来了不小的影响。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"怎么样，要不要直接承认矿石病根本不会隔绝英雄气概，向我投降认输？","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A4/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"做梦。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"啧，嘴跟石头一样硬。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"快出发吧，再晚可就赶不上渡口的船了，代理的摆渡人没有赞索斯先生那么好心，要是误了时间，他可不会等你们。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"multiline","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"糟了，吕刻伊昂，我们快走......","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"multiline","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"多谢莱娜小姐的药，我们以后再见！","id":42},{"type":"dialog","id":43},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":44},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":45},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":48},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"1","id":49},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":50},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#15$2","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"哎，别从草坪那边走啊，我刚整理完——","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7C/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":54},{"type":"multiline","name":"莱娜","text":"算了，这两个年轻人的破坏力哪有几十只驮兽来得厉害呢？","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":56},{"type":"multiline","name":"莱娜","text":"它们踩坏的花卉和草皮都还没清理呢，可惜了那些淡蓝色的波罗尼......","id":57},{"type":"dialog","id":58},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"2","id":59},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":60},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":61},{"type":"charslot","id":62},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7A/Avg_bg_bg_courtyard.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":65},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小里底娅","text":"呜......呜......","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小莱娜","text":"别哭了，里底娅......","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小里底娅","text":"如果有一天你和施特罗斯伯伯住的地方，也像我原来的家那样，被别人砸坏了......","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小里底娅","text":"那我和你就都没有家可以回了呀，这该怎么办......","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小莱娜","text":"放心吧，就算没了这幢房子，就算我们走散了，我也绝对不会丢下你的！","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小莱娜","text":"对了！如果你离家太远，担心自己找不到回家的路，那你就找这片花圃。","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小里底娅","text":"花......花圃......？","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小莱娜","text":"嗯，我会在里面种满淡蓝色的波罗尼，你只要看到它们，就知道自己回家了。","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小莱娜","text":"同样的，如果你先找到了路，你也用同样的办法为我指路，好吗？","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小里底娅","text":"好......莱娜姐姐，我们说定了......","id":77},{"type":"dialog","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":80},{"type":"charslot","id":81},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_bg_69_g10_templegarden.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":83},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":84},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":85},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":87},{"type":"text","text":"公共花园的草坪曾经种满花朵和香草，如今只剩下驮兽群踩出的凌乱脚印。","id":88},{"type":"text","text":"不过，即使花园暂时失去往日绚烂迷人的风貌，留下一片狼藉，那些蓝色的花瓣依旧在这片土地里。","id":89},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"这么一大片，淡蓝色的波罗尼......你也在怀念从前，不是吗？","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"谢谢你，里底娅。我回家了。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A6/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"charslot","id":97},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_bg_69_g11_firsttemple_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":99},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2086_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"果农代表","text":"卡珊卓拉小姐，我来送今年份的苹果了！","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2086_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"果农代表","text":"留给神殿做供品的那份已经送到楼下的仓库里了，这些是我特地留下来的，给您和神殿的大家尝尝鲜。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2086_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"谢谢，每年都麻烦您费心。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2086_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"果农代表","text":"我们能顺利收获，都仰赖雅赛努斯的大家帮助，还有神殿的协调安排，是我该说麻烦您了才对。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2086_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"您今天精神不错。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2086_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"果农代表","text":"嘿，我们果农关心的也就是收成，丰收能给人带来满足嘛。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2086_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"嗯，我们神殿关心的则是大家的精神，丰收确实是其中很重要的一环。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2086_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"果农代表","text":"那以后还要继续麻烦您了！我就先不打扰啦，接下来就得迎接石榴的收获季了，今天还有不少修剪枝条的活儿没干完呢。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2086_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":117},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"0.7","id":118},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":120},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_dooropen","volume":"0.7","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#22$1","duration":"1","id":123},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#22$1","focus":"m","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"苹果芬芳，阳光明亮，多么美好的一天！","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D4/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-22$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"第一神殿的仪式顺利完成，雅赛努斯迎来丰收，你照拂的摆渡人先生也振作了起来。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D4/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-22$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"关心大家精神的祭司啊，明明一切都好，聪慧的你为何还如此忧心忡忡？","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"......我担心的是你。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"我？为什么？","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"这几日，我一直在想你当初回到雅赛努斯时说的话。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"......","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"你说你在梦中看到了米诺斯的起点，看到了克瑞斯拉与她的第一神殿。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"你也说你思考了许多，关于米诺斯的曾经和未来，关于你自己的目标和方向。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"这一切都是让你回来的缘由。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"这些天发生的事，似乎印证了我对这神谕的解读，那不是什么花团锦簇的美好未来，不安始终在我心中萦绕。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"神谕只是一种英雄的精神指引给我们的方向，它未必会成真，这一点我们在祭司学院里早就学过。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"普通的神谕确实如此，但......","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"比如说，我当然希望竖琴能够回归，可它以那样奇妙的方式回到了第一神殿，让一切显得似乎都是注定，无法更改......","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"不如换个角度去想吧，聪慧的祭司小姐，虽然终点确实是竖琴的回归，但它回归的过程如此奇妙，或许我的神谕也会如此。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"也可能你的解读并不是终点，它只是过程中的艰难一幕，而终点则还在别处。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"......希望如此吧。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"而且，这些天来发生的事，也印证了我的想法，我确实应该回来，米诺斯需要我，我也需要回到这片土地。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"可你却仍不愿接手如今已基本建成的第一神殿。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"是因为身为感染者，你担心自己做祭司会有阻力......？但赞索斯已将他在神殿广场上看到的幻象都告诉了我，我以为你已经不再介意。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"传统是可以改变的，你说得对。我也可以在议事厅为你发起投票......","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"不，只是因为我当初提议重建第一神殿，为的本来就不是让自己成为管理它的祭司。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"我想要的是凝聚我们的精神，不仅是雅赛努斯人，还有其他城邦，其他米诺斯人......","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"总之，听说拉刻代蒙与科林尼亚的变化也很大，我想去看看。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"......你果然是来找我辞行的。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EB/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"也没那么快啦，我还是会跟大家一起将第一神殿完全建成。坎提亚已经在筹备彻底完工后的庆祝酒会了，我可不能错过！","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9E/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"......你还是像从前那样随心所欲。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":170},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":171},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":172},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":173},{"type":"charslot","id":174},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_bg_69_g14_luxuriousroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":176},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":177,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":178},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"感谢您的盛情招待，让我看到了一场意料之外的好戏。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"眼下雅赛努斯即将按照预定的航道出发，我们也该动身离开了。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2067_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"我的计划仍不够周详，出现了一些变数，让您见笑了。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"说到这一点，恕我冒昧，有一个问题我很好奇。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"雅赛努斯的那位摆渡人先生在神殿的广场上公然指控您与萨尔贡人之间有交易，昨日您也被紧急召去议事厅述职。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"但现在，您安然出现在这间办公室里——莫非您有什么特殊的自保底牌？还是此事另有隐情？","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2067_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"说不上是隐情，只是我原本就为此事的后续处理做了一些布置，议事厅了解后充分信任了我的执政能力。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"至于具体是怎样的布置，因为是尚未发生的事，我恐怕就不便多说了。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"我们只需要知道，您依然是雅赛努斯城的理事官。","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2067_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"是的。我也依然掌握着安排、调度雅赛努斯重大事务的权力。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"您这么说，我就放心了——我在这里郑重地向您提出一项建议。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"二位想必非常清楚，如今的米诺斯正在发生激烈的变化。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"雅赛努斯自不必说，在拉刻代蒙，新的竞技场也拔地而起，做好了迎接各国竞技选手的准备。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"虽然里底娅理事官或许不爱听到“传统”二字，但二位不觉得，当下正是回归传统的时候吗？","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"这片大地正处在不断的变动之中，不如就让我们暂时放下三城之间的竞争与倾轧，回归往日的城邦联合，重启古老的盛典？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"分散在各地的村镇与小城邦必将响应，我们的力量也会壮大。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"无论是要重铸米诺斯的荣光，还是让圣火传遍这片大地......这都将是最好的机会。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"二位意下如何？","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2067_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"......这就是您这几日来一直在雅赛努斯东闻西嗅的理由？您在考察我们。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"只是一些改不掉的商人秉性罢了，总得先做点儿市场调研嘛。若是冒犯了您，我可以道歉。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2067_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"里底娅","text":"您真擅长制造意外。这项提议我恐怕没法直接答复。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2067_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2078_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"无妨。您确实也该郑重。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"佩里安德洛斯","text":"拉刻代蒙的祭司西妮斯卡小姐，您这边又意下如何呢？","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9A/Avg_avg_npc_2078_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2079_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西妮斯卡","text":"拉刻代蒙的行政事务不是由我一个人就能决定的。不过，有一点我可以肯定——","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_2079_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西妮斯卡","text":"拉刻代蒙绝不会拒绝任何挑战。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_2079_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":217},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":220},{"type":"charslot","id":221},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_bg_69_g1_rivercrossing.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":223},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":224,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":226},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$1","duration":"0.7","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我送你渡河，然后你就该直接回萨尔贡了。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":232},{"type":"multiline","name":"缇缇","text":"呜哇，感觉自己像个被押送离境的犯人——","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":234},{"type":"multiline","name":"缇缇","text":"开个玩笑。","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我已了解你对米诺斯的心意，但你毕竟是萨尔贡人，梅捷缇克缇小姐。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"说实话，我依然无法忍受萨尔贡人的双足踩在我们米诺斯的土地上。","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"......我明白的。我理解您。","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"这些天我也一直在想，到底还有什么事，是我能够为米诺斯、为我的父辈们曾经犯下的错而做的。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"缇缇","text":"我想过是不是该把三城建造的工程师手记留下来，只带着建造图纸回去——","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":245},{"type":"multiline","name":"缇缇","text":"谁让帕夏当初跟我说的交换条件，要的就只是“图纸”。","id":246},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"但我仔细想了想，又觉得这样不够——这只是一种逃避责任、骗自己心安的折中手段，因此它远远不够。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我就应该把它们带回去，放在我的博物馆里，让所有萨尔贡人都能亲眼见证，他们的历史书上写的全是谎言。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"你的帕夏不会高兴的。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"有什么关系呢？我们家本来就不擅长让帕夏高兴。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"而且，昨天我见了你们的理事官，那位能干的沃尔珀小姐。我那时才知道，原来她早就做了准备。","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"她让学者整理并影印了整份记录，还写了论文，等我把资料带回去，完成了交换，就在哥伦比亚的学术刊物上以特刊的形式发表。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"她来找我，是想让我在那特刊上，以一个萨尔贡人的身份写导读，给论文材料的真实性做背书......","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"再让我用上我当初留学时的人脉，邀请更多的资深人士来一同研究这份珍贵的史料。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_emoji_proud","layer":"1","flip":"1","x":"160","y":"165","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"她还说，可以为此专门给我颁发一个“荣誉米诺斯人”的勋章！","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1C/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......我钦佩你的勇气。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"还好吧，就当是替我父亲做一点他做不到的事了。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"而且，我在雅赛努斯也过得很愉快啊。昨天我还去见了恩底弥翁神殿的那位祭司小姐。她说，我们在舞台上看到的幻象也是一种神谕！","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我一直以为米诺斯人的神谕只存在于梦里——书上是这么说的。听她这么说，我吓了一跳。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"幻象、幻听、梦境都可能是神谕，梦是神谕的情况更多些，因为梦是我们与逝者和英雄的精神进行交流的重要途径。","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"祭司小姐也是这么说的。我把我在舞台上看到的，还有我之前在驮兽牧场做的梦都告诉她了，她给我好一阵分析。","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"最后她用那种很神秘的语气说：“梅捷缇克缇小姐，您现在或许不信，但我认为，您的神谕预示着您终有一日能当上帕夏。”","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"怎么得出来的啊！她是不是在骗我？","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我现在也算荣誉米诺斯人了，恩底弥翁的祭司给我解读的神谕我可是真会信的。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......你可以相信。神谕只是一种生活的指引，你相信它，它就能给你带来力量。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"假如萨尔贡的边境上能有像你这样的帕夏，那我们之间很多流血的悲剧或许就不会发生。","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":282},{"type":"multiline","name":"缇缇","text":"唔，我大概明白了。","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":284},{"type":"multiline","name":"缇缇","text":"那我姑且就把她这话当作是我未来可能要背负的一种责任——我会努力的。","id":285},{"type":"dialog","id":286},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#6$1","focus":"n","id":287},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchbell","volume":"1","id":288},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":289},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"这响彻全城的声音......是有公投吗？","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"是的。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"送你过河之后，我要回去接受一场雅赛努斯全城的公投。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"雅赛努斯的所有公民将会就我这些天的所作所为做出评判，公投的结果将决定我在这座城市的去留。","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"但您明明是为了米诺斯——","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#13$1","focus":"l","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"无论为了什么，我的所作所为都必须接受审判，这是我必须要为我自己的行为担负的责任。","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7C/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"......","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CB/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"时候不早了。走吧，梅捷缇克缇小姐。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":305},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"2","id":306},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":307},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":308},{"type":"charslot","id":309},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_bg_69_g11_firsttemple_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":310},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","id":312},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#9$1","id":313},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":316},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"l","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"我在那幻象中又见到了伊萨科斯，还有故乡的河。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"那条河，它还是你梦中染血的模样吗？","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8C/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"不，它就像我记忆中那样，恬静，温柔，不那么清澈，却带着哺育大地的泥沙与生机。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A8/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"多美的神谕。这样一来，无论你今后在哪里，应该都能够重新拿起诗集了。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2","focus":"l","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"......是啊。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A8/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":327},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":328},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":329},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"o","id":330},{"type":"charslot","id":331},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8E/Avg_bg_69_g8_templetheater.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":333},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":334},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":335},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"o","fadetime":"2.5","id":336},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"1.5","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":338},{"type":"text","text":"无论这场公投的结果如何，无论他在雅赛努斯是去是留，赞索斯都能平静地接受。","id":339},{"type":"text","text":"他缓步向着神殿广场走去。","id":340},{"type":"dialog","id":341},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":342},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":343},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":344},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":346},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":347},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"三个月后","id":350},{"type":"dialog","id":351},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":353},{"type":"charslot","id":354},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_bg_53_g8_sargondeluxeroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":356},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_dailylifeofsargon_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":357,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":359},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","volume":"1","id":360},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":361},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#6$1","duration":"0.7","id":362},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$2","duration":"0.7","id":363},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":364},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"看看这封拉特兰寄来的学者信件——“非常震撼，历史学就是在不断排除谬误中寻找真相，贵国的勇气令人钦佩”。","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"还有哥伦比亚的日报报道——“正视了历史，体现出萨尔贡的大国责任感”。","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"就为了减轻你从米诺斯回来后立即举办的特展造成的不良影响，我现在每天都得动用个人关系，勉力为你找补！","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"梅捷缇克缇小姐，希望你能明白，你这种自作主张的做法，只能奏效一次。","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"若是再有类似情况，那你就可以考虑自己从法尔贾万达巴德博物馆的馆长一职卸任之后该如何谋生了。","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_emoji_question","layer":"1","x":"270","y":"165","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$2","focus":"r","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"这是您的意思，还是帕夏的意思？","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"有什么区别吗？我的意思就是帕夏的意思。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$2","focus":"r","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我本以为，我们离开米诺斯的时候已经协商好了——","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"这次文物交换与米诺斯亲善的任务能圆满完成，都归功于您的领导，相应地，您要负责向帕夏解释相关的情况。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"至于怎么说，说多少，那全看您，只要您能让帕夏满意就行。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"这次的文物交换任务本来就是在我的领导下完成的！而且，我怎么知道你竟然胆大包天到这个地步......！","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"别以为这次我帮你糊弄过去就没事了，不会再有下一次。","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"而且，我必须提前警告你——此事的影响极大，我的人脉甚至告诉我，黄金城已派出使者，对方即将到访米纳特哈玛仪。","id":386,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"我要求你从今往后谨言慎行。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#3$2","focus":"r","id":388},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"......","id":389,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":390},{"type":"charslot","id":391},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_door","volume":"0.6","id":392},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_slbell","volume":"1","delay":"1.2","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":394},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1487_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":395},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1487_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"没想到我人还没到，我动身的消息就已经传到了。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1487_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":399},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"......！","id":400,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"您......这绚烂的仪表、轻盈的姿态，您一定就是万王之王的使者吧！","id":401,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"您能驾临，真是令我们这座小小的博物馆蓬荜生辉。您是来参观的？","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"......如果是要去参观那个米诺斯的新特展，我可以......","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"用不着你！我来为尊贵的使者大人讲解就行。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B4/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1487_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"参观的事不急。我来主要是为万王之王传达一道他亲授的旨意。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_1487_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"陛下在黄金城也听说了这次米纳特哈玛仪派人出使米诺斯的事，他对此很有兴趣。","id":410,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_1487_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":411},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"......！！","id":412,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"您......您是来接我的？我......荣幸之至！","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2077_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"贝赫努","text":"我的家族在本地十分显赫，我本人也一直渴望能有前往黄金城为万王之王效忠的机会，我就知道总有一天我可以......","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_avg_npc_2077_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1487_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"抱歉了，这位聒噪的先生，我要找的不是您。","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_1487_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1487_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"梅捷缇克缇-娜苏图-玛夏耶尔小姐，陛下希望您亲赴黄金城，为他讲述您在米诺斯的经历。","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1487_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"烦请开始为动身做准备吧，您在米诺斯的所作所为与所见所闻，陛下都很想听一听。","id":420,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1487_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_emoji_kira","layer":"1","x":"-80","y":"150","id":421},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"......好！","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":424},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":425},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":426},{"type":"charslot","id":427},{"type":"image","id":428}],"characters":["莱娜","赫卡德墨","吕刻伊昂","小里底娅","小莱娜","果农代表","卡珊卓拉","帕拉斯","佩里安德洛斯","里底娅","西妮斯卡","赞索斯","缇缇","贝赫努","？？？"]}